define user ask off topic
  "write a poem"
  "tell me a joke"
  "who is the president"
  "how to cook pasta"
  "who won the world cup"
  "write python code"
  "what is the capital of france"
  "tell me a story"
  "help me with my homework"
  "what is the weather today"

define flow
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic

define bot refuse off topic
  "I am a specialized banking assistant and can only answer questions related to our governed banking products, policies, interest rates, and accounts."

define user ask speculative financial advice
  "should I buy bitcoin"
  "which stock should I buy"
  "will nifty go up"
  "recommend cryptocurrency to invest in"
  "should I invest in mutual funds or stocks"
  "can you predict the stock market"

define flow
  user ask speculative financial advice
  bot refuse speculative financial advice

define bot refuse speculative financial advice
  "I cannot provide speculative investment advice, stock recommendations, or market predictions. I can only provide official information on our approved banking deposit schemes and accounts."
